<mxCell id="c1011" value="This overview shows every screen and its primary navigation only. Pop-ups and their outcomes, Back, returns after save/photo, Android hand-offs and in-screen state changes are in&lt;br&gt;01-Full-Application-Wireflow (technical master) and:&lt;br&gt;1. Authentication &amp;amp; Session → 02-Module-Authentication-and-Session&lt;br&gt;2. Dashboard &amp;amp; Main Navigation → 03-Module-Home-Dashboard&lt;br&gt;3. Equipment &amp;amp; QR Scanning → 04-Module-Equipment-Scan-and-Inspection&lt;br&gt;4. Inspection &amp;amp; Checklist → 04-Module-Equipment-Scan-and-Inspection&lt;br&gt;5. PDF Reports → 05-Module-Inspection-Report-and-PDF&lt;br&gt;6. Corrective Actions → 06-Module-Corrective-Actions&lt;br&gt;7. History &amp;amp; Captured Photos → 07-Module-History-and-Captured-Photos&lt;br&gt;8. Administration (admin only) → 08-Module-Admin-Tools&lt;br&gt;9. Settings &amp;amp; Safety Assistant → 02-Module-Authentication-and-Session, 09-Module-Safety-Assistant-and-Voice-Notes&lt;br&gt;Role views: 10-Role-Admin-User-Flow, 11-Role-Inspector-User-Flow." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#1e293b;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="g_note1008"><mxGeometry x="7.0" y="20.0" width="1046.0" height="170.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
